Use https://crates.io/crates/cpal to list and provide audio input
then use 
```rust
.register_uri_scheme_protocol("stream", move |app_handle, request| {
            // Handle the request for the audio file path
            let path = request.uri().replace("stream://localhost/", "");
            let mut file = File::open(path).expect("Failed to open audio file");
            let mut buffer = Vec::new();
            file.read_to_end(&mut buffer).expect("Failed to read file");

            // You will need to handle content-range headers for true streaming in the browser
            // (see official Tauri docs for full implementation details on range requests)
            tauri::ipc::ResponseBuilder::new()
                .status(200)
                .header("Content-Type", "audio/wav") // Adjust content type as needed
                .body(buffer)
                .build()
        })
```
to stream the audio data to the webview

```js   
    const streamUrl = `stream://localhost/${encodeURIComponent(filePath)}`;
    const audioElement = new Audio(streamUrl);
    audioElement.play();
```

